" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n3068\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"3115\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀκέλυφος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sem casca ou cápsula, de fruto.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n3069\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n3069\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"3116\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀκενόδοξος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Livre de presunção ou vaidade.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n3070\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n3070\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"3117\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀκενόσπουδος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Que evita empenhos vãos ou esforços inúteis.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n3071\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n3071\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"3118\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀκέντητος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Que não necessita de espora; não picado; sem defeito.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n3072\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n3072\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"3119\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀκέντριστος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Equivalente a ἀκέντητος na primeira acepção.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n3072a\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n3072a\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"3120\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄκεντρος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sem ferrão, sem esporas ou espinhos; insensível à espora; sem ponta; em astrologia, fora dos ângulos principais.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n3073\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n3073\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"3121\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀκεντρότης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Ausência de posição angular na astrologia.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n3074\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n3074\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"3122\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀκέομαι</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Curar, sanar, estancar; reparar, consertar; remediar um dano, compensar ou fazer reparação.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n3075\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n3075\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"3123\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀκεόντως</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Silenciosamente, sem ruído.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n3075a\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n3075a\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"3124\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄκερα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Vestimenta luxuosa, segundo glosa.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n3076\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n3076\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"3125\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀκεραιόομαι</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Ser ou tornar-se ἀκέραιος, íntegro ou puro.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>";
